    "synopsis": {
        "native": "L\u2019arriv\u00e9e de Toto le marcassin chez Madeleine, le voyage de Vincent en Inde et ses d\u00e9m\u00eal\u00e9s avec les singes, ou les r\u00eaves de Joseph provoqu\u00e9s par la machine \u00e0 pression continue. Trois histoires que va partager Pierre et qui convoquent d\u2019une mani\u00e8re ou d\u2019une autre notre rapport \u00e0 l\u2019animal, \u00e0 cet autre prochain.",
        "english": "The arrival of Toto, a young wild boar, at Madeleine's home, Vincent's altercations with monkeys during his trip to India, and Joseph's dreams caused by his artificial breathing machine\u2014three stories that Pierre shares with us, which, in different ways, evoke our relationship with animals, our fellow beings."
